{"id":"traveler-s-clothes","name":{"en":"Traveler's Clothes","ja":"旅人の服","tc":"旅人服","sc":"旅人服"},"desc1":{"en":"These are basic clothes a traveler wears. Attention was paid to durability than comfort.","ja":"「旅人が着る一般的なお洋服ね。　見た目や着心地よりは、丈夫さ重視かしら」","tc":"「這是旅行者一般會穿的服飾，　比起外觀和舒適感，更注重的是耐用度。」","sc":"“这是旅行者一般会穿的服饰，　比起外观和舒适感，更注重的是耐用度。”"},"desc2":{"en":"They're kind of stiff... Well, I can't really be fussy about it...","ja":"「うん…。結構ごわごわするんだよね…。　まぁ、わがままは言わないけどさ…」","tc":"「嗯……皺巴巴的呢……　不過，我是不會為了這點耍任性啦……」","sc":"“嗯……皱巴巴的呢……　不过，我是不会为了这点耍任性啦……”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","level":5,"chars":["firis","liane","ilmeria","drossel","shanon","heintz","revy","kald","angriff","oskar","sophie","plachta"],"categories":[{"id":"armor","name":{"en":"(Armor)","ja":"（防具）","tc":"（防具）","sc":"（防具）"},"icon":"shallie-category-a-light-armor","add":false}],"monsters":[{"id":"beast","name":{"en":"Beast","ja":"ケモノ","tc":"獸人","sc":"兽人"}},{"id":"void-flower-fairy","name":{"en":"Void Flower Fairy","ja":"虚無の花妖精","tc":"虛無的花妖精","sc":"虚无的花妖精"}},{"id":"justrun-foryourlife","name":{"en":"Justrun-Foryourlife","ja":"ゲキヤバイダケ","tc":"激惡菇","sc":"激恶菇"}},{"id":"griffonian","name":{"en":"Griffonian","ja":"グリフォニアン","tc":"獅鷲","sc":"狮鹫"}},{"id":"deadly-spirit","name":{"en":"Deadly Spirit","ja":"死告花の精","tc":"報喪花精","sc":"报丧花精"}},{"id":"devil-horn","name":{"en":"Devil Horn","ja":"デビルホーン","tc":"惡魔之角","sc":"恶魔之角"}},{"id":"silent-beast","name":{"en":"Silent Beast","ja":"沈黙の魔獣","tc":"沉默的魔獸","sc":"沉默的魔兽"}},{"id":"island-fish","name":{"en":"Island Fish","ja":"島魚","tc":"島魚","sc":"岛鱼"}},{"id":"lich","name":{"en":"Lich","ja":"リッチ","tc":"巫妖","sc":"巫妖"}},{"id":"shaula","name":{"en":"Shaula","ja":"シャウラ","tc":"尾宿八","sc":"尾宿八"}}],"equip":{"hp":0,"mp":0,"atk":0,"dfn":5,"spd":0},"shopslot_set":[{"id":"everything-alchemy","name":{"en":"Everything Alchemy","ja":"よろず錬金術士店","tc":"鍊金術士雜貨店","sc":"炼金术士杂货店"}},{"id":"lilie-laurier","name":{"en":"Lilie Laurier","ja":"リーリエ・ローリエ","tc":"莉莉艾‧蘿莉艾","sc":"莉莉艾‧萝莉艾"}}],"index":356}